WEBVTT

00:00:18.585 --> 00:00:23.065
These days, no matter what I'm doing

00:00:23.089 --> 00:00:27.458
His face keeps popping up

00:00:29.696 --> 00:00:34.210
Twenty-four hours is chock-full of time

00:00:34.234 --> 00:00:39.263
But he's tied it all up

00:00:40.573 --> 00:00:45.238
Now, I'm gonna start working

00:00:45.612 --> 00:00:51.278
But he always gets in my way

00:00:51.651 --> 00:00:56.384
I'm a really, really, really, really hard worker

00:00:56.756 --> 00:01:01.956
But I was already under his spell

00:01:02.862 --> 00:01:07.243
No matter what I'm doing, I can't help
but think about him

00:01:07.267 --> 00:01:12.398
And my mind is filled with him

00:01:13.506 --> 00:01:19.522
| just can't do anything now
unless he's there for me

00:01:19.546 --> 00:01:26.418
He's always there inside me,
me, me, me, me, me, me

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:38.455
Stop!

00:01:41.367 --> 00:01:42.835
Stop!

00:02:00.954 --> 00:02:01.697
<i>Heart 9 Guilty — Miyu's Past</i>

00:02:01.721 --> 00:02:04.700
<i>Heart 9 Guilty — Miyu's Past
"Heart - Guilty - Miyu's Past"</i>

00:02:04.724 --> 00:02:06.852
<i>Heart 9 Guilty — Miyu's Past</i>

00:02:22.308 --> 00:02:23.776
Damn!

00:02:29.015 --> 00:02:31.712
Are you part of the Eagles?

00:02:33.653 --> 00:02:36.315
Take that! And that! And that!

00:02:41.561 --> 00:02:42.404
Why you!

00:02:42.428 --> 00:02:46.262
Stop it. Miyu doesn't want to
hurt anyone anymore.

00:02:47.901 --> 00:02:48.677
Give me that!

00:02:48.701 --> 00:02:51.068
Hey, we're only supposed to scare her.

00:02:51.604 --> 00:02:53.072
Supposed to?

00:02:53.740 --> 00:02:54.517
Shuddup!

00:02:54.541 --> 00:02:57.101
She's making a fool of us and I'm
starting to get pissed for real!

00:02:57.844 --> 00:03:01.144
| see, so there's someone else
behind all this.

00:03:05.051 --> 00:03:06.780
He just had to open his big mouth.

00:03:08.922 --> 00:03:10.232
Hey, lay off!

00:03:10.256 --> 00:03:13.385
Shuddup! Why don't you at least
act a little scared?!

00:03:14.694 --> 00:03:16.505
| won't be held responsible
for whatever happens.

00:03:16.529 --> 00:03:17.997
Take that!

00:03:27.607 --> 00:03:29.575
Ran Kick!

00:03:31.611 --> 00:03:32.421
Ran!

00:03:32.445 --> 00:03:36.458
Don't, Miyu. If you go any further,
it won't be pretty.

00:03:36.482 --> 00:03:37.950
For them...

00:03:38.451 --> 00:03:40.715
...or for you!

00:03:48.161 --> 00:03:50.255
Miyu's my precious friend!

00:03:50.697 --> 00:03:54.725
If you're gonna insist on fighting,
I'll take you on!

00:03:55.602 --> 00:03:57.079
Ran!

00:03:57.103 --> 00:03:59.448
Mr. Policeman, come on,
over here! Hurry!

00:03:59.472 --> 00:04:00.082
Come on! I said, over here! Hurry!

00:04:00.106 --> 00:04:01.951
Not good. Let's run!
Come on! I said, over here! Hurry!

00:04:01.975 --> 00:04:01.998
Not good. Let's run!

00:04:07.614 --> 00:04:09.275
Miyu, are you okay?

00:04:10.250 --> 00:04:12.361
Ran, I...

00:04:12.385 --> 00:04:14.163
| know.

00:04:14.187 --> 00:04:16.799
You were trying to settle this
on your own, right?

00:04:16.823 --> 00:04:20.436
