00:04:26.633 --> 00:04:28.010
I'm sorry.

00:04:28.034 --> 00:04:29.812
Are you okay, Ran?!

00:04:29.836 --> 00:04:32.771
Thanks, you were a great help,
Second Place and Otohata.

00:04:33.306 --> 00:04:35.017
