00:05:02.068 --> 00:05:03.558
Lucky bastard.

00:05:06.139 --> 00:05:07.583
Boss!

00:05:07.607 --> 00:05:09.075
Boss!

00:05:10.276 --> 00:05:11.744
Hideki!

00:05:17.283 --> 00:05:19.061
Hideki!

00:05:19.085 --> 00:05:20.729
Damn, is this for real?!

00:05:20.753 --> 00:05:23.532
Damn it! They play dirty!

00:05:23.556 --> 00:05:26.253
We can't let those Resistance
bastards get away with this!

00:05:28.227 --> 00:05:29.805
Hey! Stop right there!

00:05:29.829 --> 00:05:32.355
Hang in there! Hang in there, Hideki!

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:35.668
Damn it!

00:05:37.203 --> 00:05:39.069
Coward!

00:05:42.308 --> 00:05:43.503
I'll never forgive you!

00:05:43.843 --> 00:05:44.810
I'll never forgive you!

00:05:45.778 --> 00:05:47.803
Miyu Yamazaki!

00:05:49.549 --> 00:05:51.017
| had no idea.

00:05:53.353 --> 00:05:54.863
Are you okay, Miyu?

00:05:54.887 --> 00:05:56.265
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:05:56.289 --> 00:05:57.866
But this is a bad situation.

00:05:57.890 --> 00:05:59.601
Prank emails are one thing,

00:05:59.625 --> 00:06:01.904
but I never thought they'd directly
come and attack you.

00:06:01.928 --> 00:06:03.505
This kind of harassment tends
to keep escalating

00:06:03.529 --> 00:06:06.508
if you don't do anything about it.

00:06:06.532 --> 00:06:09.078
We better find the culprit quick.

00:06:09.102 --> 00:06:10.412
What about the Eagles?

00:06:10.436 --> 00:06:14.216
This is the emblem of their
gang, right? Then...

00:06:14.240 --> 00:06:17.119
It's true a gang named the Eagles
used to exist,

00:06:17.143 --> 00:06:19.722
but I'm pretty sure it fell apart
a long time ago.

00:06:19.746 --> 00:06:23.559
But the culprit obviously has some
sort of grudge against Miyu.

00:06:23.583 --> 00:06:26.362
Say, Miyu, don't you have any idea
who might have a grudge against you

00:06:26.386 --> 00:06:28.354
from back when you were
a gang member?

00:06:30.189 --> 00:06:31.033
Miyu?

00:06:31.057 --> 00:06:34.970
| don't know. I don't know, too
many things come to mind.

00:06:34.994 --> 00:06:39.397
Because... Because Miyu did a lot
of bad things back then.

00:06:39.866 --> 00:06:42.711
| made so much trouble for everybody.

00:06:42.735 --> 00:06:44.279
