as an email, right?

00:06:53.179 --> 00:06:56.592
Shouldn't you be able to find out
the number of the sender's cell?

00:06:56.616 --> 00:06:58.560
It's blocked, so I can't
find out the number.

00:06:58.584 --> 00:07:00.829
