cell phone statements?

00:07:18.905 --> 00:07:20.373
Statements?

00:07:21.674 --> 00:07:21.683
Yamazaki

00:07:21.707 --> 00:07:22.299
Yamazaki
Yamazaki

00:07:23.276 --> 00:07:24.520
Come to think of it,

00:07:24.544 --> 00:07:27.222
