by someone the other day.

00:07:27.246 --> 00:07:30.526
For real?! Then that's when it
must've been stolen!

00:07:30.550 --> 00:07:33.019
Say, everyone, here's a thought.

00:07:33.486 --> 00:07:36.298
No matter what kind of grudge the
person may have against Miyu,

00:07:36.322 --> 00:07:38.901
isn't it strange to be harassing her over it now?

00:07:38.925 --> 00:07:40.202
What are you getting at?

00:07:40.226 --> 00:07:42.871
The culprit probably just saw Miyu recently

00:07:42.895 --> 00:07:44.873
and remembered the old grudge.

00:07:44.897 --> 00:07:48.026
The culprit may actually be
pretty close by.

00:07:48.568 --> 00:07:49.812
Close by...

00:07:49.836 --> 00:07:51.304
He's here.

00:07:52.238 --> 00:07:54.002
Come on, get to your seats!

00:07:55.241 --> 00:07:59.075
In the meantime, I'll go question the
old gang members after school.

00:07:59.612 --> 00:08:01.390
Maybe we'll find out something.

00:08:01.414 --> 00:08:01.490
Me tool

00:08:01.514 --> 00:08:02.391
Hey, hurry up and get to your seats!
Me tool

00:08:02.415 --> 00:08:02.458
Hey, hurry up and get to your seats!

00:08:02.482 --> 00:08:03.025
Hey, hurry up and get to your seats!
Me tool

