00:13:02.281 --> 00:13:03.658
Yeah, I guess.

00:13:03.682 --> 00:13:05.594
Say, Ran.

00:13:05.618 --> 00:13:09.213
Don't say anything about this
to Yamato, okay?

00:13:09.622 --> 00:13:11.283
