00:14:37.576 --> 00:14:40.622
Hey, Ran, don't make Miyu cry.

00:14:40.646 --> 00:14:43.391
What the heck? It's not my fault!

00:14:43.415 --> 00:14:43.992
Let's go!

00:14:44.016 --> 00:14:45.950
