00:15:33.432 --> 00:15:35.161
Don't worry about it.

00:15:36.535 --> 00:15:38.246
Yamato!

00:15:38.270 --> 00:15:39.514
Bakappuru...

00:15:39.538 --> 00:15:40.715
Lucky her.

00:15:40.739 --> 00:15:41.816
No fair.

00:15:41.840 --> 00:15:43.330
