00:15:44.109 --> 00:15:45.599
Yamato!

00:15:47.179 --> 00:15:49.291
Oh, I got another one.

00:15:49.315 --> 00:15:49.324
I'll beat the crap out of you. Be
prepared. Oh, I got another one.

00:15:49.348 --> 00:15:50.158
I'll beat the crap out
of you. Be prepared.

00:15:50.182 --> 00:15:51.775
I'll beat the crap out of you.
