That's the kind of people
who do this stuff.

00:16:04.530 --> 00:16:06.498
It's not worth taking it to heart.

00:16:11.337 --> 00:16:13.114
That's true. Thank you.

00:16:13.138 --> 00:16:16.318
Well, I'm going to go
pick up empty cans.

00:16:16.342 --> 00:16:18.253
Oh, then I'll go too.

00:16:18.277 --> 00:16:19.521
Oh, it's okay, it's okay.

00:16:19.545 --> 00:16:22.480
You stay there with Otohata and
enjoy your time together!

00:16:23.882 --> 00:16:25.372
Miyu!

00:16:29.355 --> 00:16:31.533
You're so kind, Otohata.

00:16:31.557 --> 00:16:33.969
You always say the right things.

00:16:33.993 --> 00:16:35.337
Not really.

00:16:35.361 --> 00:16:37.193
| just say whatever I'm thinking.

00:16:40.399 --> 00:16:44.312
| can understand trying to find
former gang members,

00:16:44.336 --> 00:16:46.614
but why do we have to do it
from here, Ran?!

00:16:46.638 --> 00:16:49.217
It's a good spot with a great view.

00:16:49.241 --> 00:16:51.453
Second Place, quit complaining
and start looking.

00:16:51.477 --> 00:16:54.155
1 Acrophobic | don't
know any gang members!

00:16:54.179 --> 00:16:55.044
1
Acrophobic

00:16:57.816 --> 00:16:59.094
Ran!

00:16:59.118 --> 00:17:02.864
Honda, you bitch! You here
to cause trouble again?!

00:17:02.888 --> 00:17:07.168
It isn't like that. I lost track of
Harue, so I'm looking for her.

00:17:07.192 --> 00:17:08.853
What? You're just lost?

00:17:09.361 --> 00:17:10.105
Oh, well.

00:17:10.129 --> 00:17:11.373
<i>Oh, Honda!</i>

00:17:11.397 --> 00:17:12.741
What?!

00:17:12.765 --> 00:17:16.077
Do you know anything about
a gang called the Eagles?

00:17:16.101 --> 00:17:18.468
They're an old Shibuya gang.

00:17:19.071 --> 00:17:20.664
The Eagles?

00:17:22.241 --> 00:17:24.335
Picking up trash.

00:17:25.911 --> 00:17:28.676
Harue used to be in a gang once.

00:17:29.381 --> 00:17:32.694
I'm pretty sure the gang she was in
was the Eagles.

00:17:32.718 --> 00:17:34.186
What did you say?!

00:17:38.524 --> 00:17:40.959
Say, let's call it quits already.

00:17:45.431 --> 00:17:47.593
So you noticed, Miyu Yamazaki.

00:17:48.300 --> 00:17:49.768
You coward!

00:17:50.803 --> 00:17:53.170
Coward!

00:17:54.139 --> 00:17:56.918
You were that girl. Then...

00:17:56.942 --> 00:17:59.287
That's right, and this is revenge.

00:17:59.311 --> 00:18:01.905
For Hideki and for me!

00:18:02.614 --> 00:18:03.725
What do you mean?

00:18:03.749 --> 00:18:06.127
Because Hideki lost to you,

00:18:06.151 --> 00:18:08.229
not only was he forced to step down
from being the leader,

00:18:08.253 --> 00:18:10.498
he was kicked out of the gang.

00:18:10.522 --> 00:18:12.000
It's your fault!

00:18:12.024 --> 00:18:14.823
Because of you, Hideki was... I was...

00:18:17.763 --> 00:18:19.527
Don't tell me you were...

00:18:19.998 --> 00:18:23.645
That's right, Hideki was my boyfriend.

00:18:23.669 --> 00:18:28.300
But he disappeared without
saying a word to me.

00:18:28.774 --> 00:18:30.351
| had no idea.

00:18:30.375 --> 00:18:32.053
But I don't understand.

00:18:32.077 --> 00:18:34.222
It's definitely something I did,

00:18:34.246 --> 00:18:37.443
but that was a fight with the gang's
reputation on the line!

00:18:38.450 --> 00:18:40.418
Don't mess with me, coward!

00:18:42.788 --> 00:18:46.267
You're the one that broke the promise
that it'd be a one-on-one fight

00:18:46.291 --> 00:18:47.759
and beat up Hideki with all your friends!

00:18:50.028 --> 00:18:53.623
That's wrong. That's wrong!
Miyu never did anything like that!

00:18:54.199 --> 00:18:55.667
Because that time...

00:18:59.071 --> 00:19:01.733
I'm here, Eagles! Where are you?!

00:19:02.107 --> 00:19:03.734
Quit hiding and come on out!

00:19:08.447 --> 00:19:11.292
Wow, looks like you actually came
alone like you were supposed to.

00:19:11.316 --> 00:19:13.194
What's going on?

00:19:13.218 --> 00:19:16.210
Wasn't this a one-on-one fight
between the leaders?

00:19:16.588 --> 00:19:18.299
You just don't get it.

00:19:18.323 --> 00:19:21.293
It doesn't matter as long
as you win the fight!

00:19:21.960 --> 00:19:23.238
Coward!

00:19:23.262 --> 00:19:24.739
Call me whatever you want!

00:19:24.763 --> 00:19:26.231
Get her!

00:19:31.803 --> 00:19:33.328
You're lying!

00:19:33.772 --> 00:19:35.262
You're lying!

00:19:39.645 --> 00:19:41.113
Harue...

00:19:42.114 --> 00:19:45.573
Quit lying, Yamazaki!
You're just BS-ing!

00:19:46.785 --> 00:19:51.633
I'm not lying. I was ambushed, just
like you did to me the other day.

00:19:51.657 --> 00:19:57.255
But it doesn't change the fact that Miyu
hurt you and your boyfriend, does it?

00:19:59.264 --> 00:20:00.942
I'm sorry.

00:20:00.966 --> 00:20:02.832
I'm really sorry.

00:20:04.770 --> 00:20:06.238
You...

00:20:09.575 --> 00:20:12.135
Then, the reason Hideki disappeared...

00:20:13.045 --> 00:20:15.036
...was because he didn't
like me anymore?

00:20:18.250 --> 00:20:20.651
No... No!

00:20:21.086 --> 00:20:23.464
| can understand how you feel.

00:20:23.488 --> 00:20:25.013
What?!

00:20:26.491 --> 00:20:31.452
It makes you so sad, because the
person you cared about is gone.

00:20:32.197 --> 00:20:34.609
You want to believe that it was
someone else's fault and not yours.

00:20:34.633 --> 00:20:40.697
| can understand, because there's
someone I care about too.

00:20:41.840 --> 00:20:43.365
Yamazaki...

00:20:45.277 --> 00:20:46.721
Harue...

00:20:46.745 --> 00:20:47.755
Mami?

00:20:47.779 --> 00:20:50.646
| don't know what you went
through in Shibuya,

00:20:51.116 --> 00:20:54.313
but you're a Bukuro gal now,
aren't you?

00:20:55.420 --> 00:20:58.967
Then quit getting hung up on
stupid things like the past

00:20:58.991 --> 00:21:01.653
and live with pride as a Bukuro gal.

00:21:02.027 --> 00:21:04.519
Wow, you say some good
things once in a while.

00:21:04.896 --> 00:21:07.075
Don't make fun of me, Kotobuki!

00:21:07.099 --> 00:21:09.534
Harue, you were in the wrong in this case.

00:21:10.869 --> 00:21:12.337
Apologize.

00:21:16.675 --> 00:21:19.454
Yamazaki, I was...

00:21:19.478 --> 00:21:21.222
It's okay.

00:21:21.246 --> 00:21:23.191
You don't have to apologize.

00:21:23.215 --> 00:21:27.028
We're even now. We don't
owe each other anything.

00:21:27.052 --> 00:21:28.542
Yamazaki...

00:21:31.857 --> 00:21:34.519
Don't worry, she's not stupid.

00:21:36.762 --> 00:21:38.992
Man, you're so soft!

00:21:39.398 --> 00:21:40.675
You think so?

00:21:40.699 --> 00:21:42.463
Hey, Kotobuki.

00:21:43.568 --> 00:21:46.781
Don't get carried, thinking you've won
because of this or something.

00:21:46.805 --> 00:21:49.083
We haven't settled this yet!

00:21:49.107 --> 00:21:52.042
| know, I'll take you on anytime!

00:21:56.948 --> 00:21:59.694
Man! Totally okay! No problem!

00:21:59.718 --> 00:22:02.449
Clearing up some trouble
sure makes me hungry!

00:22:02.854 --> 00:22:05.516
Ran, Aya, thanks for
your cooperation!

00:22:05.991 --> 00:22:07.168
Don't mind it.

00:22:07.192 --> 00:22:09.737
Treat me to a hamburger to show
your appreciation!

00:22:09.761 --> 00:22:12.958
I'm in a good mood, so maybe
I'll even toss in a shake too!

00:22:15.000 --> 00:22:15.843
What's wrong?

00:22:15.867 --> 00:22:16.744
| don't have it!

00:22:16.768 --> 00:22:19.465
| don't have the bag with all
the empty cans I picked up!

00:22:21.073 --> 00:22:22.283
Oh, that's when!

00:22:22.307 --> 00:22:24.332
Sorry, Ran, Aya! I'll see you tomorrow!

00:22:24.910 --> 00:22:26.754
The hamburger!

00:22:26.778 --> 00:22:28.456
| guess she's still going for it.

00:22:28.480 --> 00:22:30.346
Her first kiss with my bro...

00:22:35.754 --> 00:22:42.036
| hate it, you're always laughing

00:22:42.060 --> 00:22:48.227
And so strong and cute and popular

00:22:48.667 --> 00:22:55.016
| hate it, I'm so dull and slow

00:22:55.040 --> 00:23:00.308
And no one needs me...

00:23:01.279 --> 00:23:07.562
You're smart and always so perfect

00:23:07.586 --> 00:23:13.355
People probably just make fun of me

00:23:13.925 --> 00:23:20.241
To be honest, I want to try talking to you

00:23:20.265 --> 00:23:25.947
| want to become friends with you

00:23:25.971 --> 00:23:31.933
| was so envious of you

00:23:32.310 --> 00:23:37.892
And my shoulders would tremble as I cried alone

00:23:37.916 --> 00:23:45.433
Tell me, are you alone and afraid, too?

00:23:45.457 --> 00:23:51.372
Is everyone miserable and weak?

00:23:51.396 --> 00:23:58.045
If only I had more courage

00:23:58.069 --> 00:24:04.475
| would have given you a hug

00:24:05.410 --> 00:24:06.654
Next Super GALS!

00:24:06.678 --> 00:24:09.791
Next Super GALS! Social studies
visit, Sayo is excited, Yamato is annoyed.

00:24:09.815 --> 00:24:10.091
Next Super GALS!
Then, suddenly, a man barges in!

00:24:10.115 --> 00:24:11.426
Then, suddenly, a man barges in!

00:24:11.450 --> 00:24:13.461
Sayo is kidnapped! The family
is horrified!

00:24:13.485 --> 00:24:15.596
What?! Sayo and Masato were kidnapped

00:24:15.620 --> 00:24:17.532
while visiting the police box
for observation?!

00:24:17.556 --> 00:24:20.034
What the heck were you doing, Bro?!
You good-for-nothing!

00:24:20.058 --> 00:24:21.536
Come on, Mom,

00:24:21.560 --> 00:24:23.271
we'll pursue the suspect's car
in the mini-patrol car!

00:24:23.295 --> 00:24:24.939
Sayo, Masato, hang in there!

00:24:24.963 --> 00:24:27.041
I'll save you for sure!

